    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d418-a3-a4">

                <pb facs="0415" n="395" xml:id="pg395"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 1, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>On Tuesday, 1st of March, I was called about 6 a. m. to see the murderer,
                    Williams. He was lying in a pool of blood and was just dying. The wound which
                    caused death was on the left side of the neck, and had severed the principal
                    arteries.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>H. W. BOONE, <hi rendition="#italic">M. D</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
